(757, 324, 'Expert in Persona Development needed for wireframes and UI for a telemedicine platform', 'We would like to hire an independent specialist for wireframes and UI for a telemedicine platform. Our company works in EdTech. Required skills: Persona Development, Sketch and InVision. We work in short iterations with a brief weekly call. We may extend the contract if the collaboration goes well. Expected duration: about 8 weeks.', 1560.00, 1960.00, 'OPEN', '2026-11-24 11:48:33'),
(758, 186, 'Build a responsive admin dashboard for a logistics company (Redux)', 'Our team is planning to get a responsive admin dashboard for a logistics company done and is looking for a reliable freelancer (we operate in Travel and Hospitality). Required skills: Redux, Bootstrap and Vite Tooling. We will provide all required accounts and access after the contract starts. Documentation of the final result is part of the deliverables. Expected duration: about 9 weeks.', 700.00, 1240.00, 'OPEN', '2026-11-24 18:45:09'),
(759, 311, 'Set up a keyword and competitor research report (Community Management)', 'A small Real Estate company is looking for someone to handle a keyword and competitor research report. Required skills: Community Management, Marketing Analytics and Content Marketing. The budget is flexible for the right candidate. Communication in English is required; Vietnamese is a plus. Expected duration: about 9 weeks.', 1370.00, 2570.00, 'OPEN', '2026-11-25 15:39:39'),
(760, 714, 'Looking for help with a 2D platformer prototype for mobile', 'An early-stage Real Estate company is looking for someone to handle a 2D platformer prototype for mobile. Required skills: Level Design, 2D Game Art and Game AI. We will provide all required accounts and access after the contract starts. We work in short iterations with a brief weekly call. Expected duration: about 8 weeks.', 440.00, 530.00, 'OPEN', '2026-11-26 01:01:23');

